  - "Du skj\xF8t: n\xE5 ser alle v\xE5penet ditt over tingen din!"
  - "Ammuit: nyt kaikki n\xE4kev\xE4t aseesi esineesi yll\xE4!"
  - "L\u0151tt\xE9l: most m\xE1r mindenki l\xE1tja a fegyvered a t\xE1rgyad f\xF6l\xF6tt!"
  - "V\xFDst\u0159el! Te\u010F v\u0161ichni vid\xED tvou zbra\u0148 nad tv\xFDm p\u0159edm\u011Btem!"
  - "Ate\u015F ettin: art\u0131k herkes e\u015Fyan\u0131n \xFCst\xFCndeki silah\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyor!"
  - "Ai tras: acum to\u021Bi \xEE\u021Bi v\u0103d arma deasupra obiectului!"
  - "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFn: gi\u1EDD m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u1EA5y s\xFAng
    c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n tr\xEAn \u0111\u1ED3 v\u1EADt!"
  - "!\uFEDA\uFEBF\uFEAE\uFECF \uFED5\uFEEE\uFED3 \uFEDA\uFEB3\uFEAA\uFEB4\uFEE3
